        "description": "XC6206 LDO regulator converts VIN_5V to VCC_3V3 for 3.3V logic rail. This module is the sole provider of VCC_3V3. Input (VIN) connects to VIN_5V global net, output (VOUT) provides VCC_3V3. VSS connects to GND. Bypass capacitors required on VIN and VOUT pins per datasheet. This module powers the CH340 V3 pin.",
