        "type": "Module",
        "name": "usb_uart_bridge",
        "description": "CH340 USB-to-UART bridge IC. VCC (pin 16) powered directly from VIN_5V global net. V3 (pin 4) requires VCC_3V3 from power_3v3 module for 3.3V logic I/O. USB differential pair (UD_P/UD_N) connects to USB connector. UART TXD (pin 2) is output, RXD (pin 3) is input - exposed as board-level UART interface. Crystal required on XI/XO pins. R232 pin determines mode (UART vs RS232). Flow control pins (CTS, DSR, RI, DCD, DTR, RTS) available but not used in this basic design.",
